- Rebranded the application: product name "dataview", application identifier
  com.dataview.app, window title, deep-link scheme dataview://, and package
  name. Data directories are therefore isolated from any installed DBX.
- Disabled the Tauri updater artifacts and repointed updater endpoints to a
  placeholder domain; releases are no longer fetched from dbxio.com.
- Repaired files damaged by duplicated patch application in the upstream
  branch (duplicate imports/blocks in useDataGridExport.ts,
  EditorSettingsDialog.vue, and openTabsPersistence.spec.ts).
- Added repository conventions (AGENTS.md instruction files).

